{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act18d0_level_act18d0_08_end",
  "groupId": "act18d0",
  "stageId": "act18d0_08",
  "title": "大雪将至",
  "storyCode": "WD-8",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18d0/level_act18d0_08_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "289abc47da4fa0d499b82cefb97a8f1c33eeed754164e459566310f015db3320",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "6下"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_manorgarden"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘶......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这种技巧......！你的肉体强度与你的判断反应截然不符，你究竟是什么东西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（尖啸）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，Mon3tr！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（悲鸣）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你令我屈辱，怪物，这是你应得的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mon3tr，调整态势，他已是强弩之末。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘶......呼......嘶......呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你受伤不轻，内卫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "彼此，叛国者。你为自己注射了药物......这理应使你剧痛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真稀奇。你仿佛一个战士的影子，你有着最优秀的战士所具备的一切素养，但你的力量却必须依赖外物......一只怪物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "战斗的痕迹尚可遮掩，但遭你浸染的土地无法恢复原状，你不该这么一意孤行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你正在恐惧，是的，倘若你真的知晓内卫的秘密，你理当感到恐惧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“每一个内卫都是一个国度”，这种充斥着修饰词语的描述，其实是在谈论一个事实。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "需要我提醒你吗？你的面具正在破裂。现实维度正对你体内的邪魔产生反应，仪式施加的牢笼出现了裂隙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还是说，你真觉得一位皇帝内卫在伯爵庄园里引发一场恐惧的湮灭，维多利亚会依旧放任不管？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "内卫的职责，在于乌萨斯存在的一切理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......笑话！我岂需要一个叛国者来教训我“职责”一词！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么，你现在所效忠的，是如今的乌萨斯，还是一个伟大的幻影？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "告诉我，内卫，不要辱没你的名号。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——告诉我当今的乌萨斯皇帝，究竟是如何对待松心山谷的事件的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "难道你敢说，那些叛乱的种子，风波的起因，都是乌萨斯皇帝的授意？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这一切因你而起！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（咆哮）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——尽管诓骗你自己吧，事实是，年轻的皇帝甚至不知道那里发生的一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们认为，皇帝不需要知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你，你们在渴求一个逝去的时代。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不去评判这是否正确，但任由一位大公死于政斗，都会成为全新叛乱的苗头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这不该由你判断。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我能预见他的死带来的种种后果。有些人出于愤怒，谋求所谓的公正而要求他死。为了抹消证据，切断联系而希望他死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而另一些，则希望他活着。希望他继续行他脱离不了的职责，或者，也有人希望以一个活着的人证为踏板，向第三集团军所有的牵扯势力发难。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他的死活无关紧要，如何处理一触即发的矛盾，才是重中之重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你难道想说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只有让一个平平无奇的乌萨斯刺客，出于个人情感杀死一位她本不可能碰触到的大公，罪行才如同被驮兽吞下的草籽般消化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......听上去，你高瞻远瞩，以一介平民身份，为我们解决了一个天大难题？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是为了避免乌萨斯进一步内耗，而做出的最好选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（异样的声音）冠冕堂皇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（嘶鸣）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叛国者！你的狡辩是对乌萨斯的污蔑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使如你所言，纵使你的行为有千百个借口有利于乌萨斯，这些决定，也不该由你去做！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——控制住你自己，内卫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我嗅得到你的谎言——你胆敢号称自己是为了乌萨斯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（它在扩散，即使只是被封存在那身装置之中的邪魔碎片，也足以毁灭这座庄园。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——落日峡谷已变成一片恐惧之地！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（如果内卫执意要取我性命......Mon3tr......先下手为强。杀死他，比保护我更有成效。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪怕帝国的荣光持续万年，那片漆黑的土地依旧不再属于乌萨斯，不再属于这片大地！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你难道要重蹈覆辙吗！？就因为你自己的失控，将帝国卷入一场远不在预见之中的战争！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你只是被先皇的宏伟愿景冲昏了头脑，乌萨斯人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嘶......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沸腾的恐惧在顷刻间收缩为实体。\n仿佛地动山摇的宣泄停止后，只有淡淡的黑色的不详光彩，自内卫面具的破损处流出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_manorgarden"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mon3tr，停下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不满的鸣叫）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......怎么？你放过了这个机会，你唯一的机会......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很清楚你的手腕，如果让Mon3tr攻击，那么那些漆黑的尖刺就会贯穿我的胸膛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘶......看来试探已经毫无意义。你知道，你很清楚地知道内卫的运作原理......你曾说我是异类，现在，却又要以人类相称？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果说我对你还有一丝认同，那也与你如今所执行的意志无关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在你对抗它们的任何一个瞬间，你仍是人类伟岸的壁垒之一。没有任何人，能剥夺你们生而为人的荣耀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至少，在你被那个注定毁灭的幻象欺骗之前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘶......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你说对了，我的确错估了许多事情......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它们因“所知”而强大。为了对抗它们，扼制一切关于它们知识的传承，成为了所有国度不成文的律法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你并非萨米的雪祀，也与萨尔贡的永恒军队无关......能看见泰拉大地境外风景的，从来都只有各国知识权力的顶点......你究竟是什么人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尽职的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的职责是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你心里已经知晓答案，我做的不比你多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我必须承认......我从未见过知晓内卫机密的外人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你犯下的罪行和你掌控的秘密，依旧令你背负诸多罪责。但我也从未见过，能与我分庭抗礼的古怪生物......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（挑衅的尖啸）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘶......你已经开始超乎我的预料......你身上的谜题甚至令人担忧，我该更谨慎些对待你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就当我听信了你的谗言吧，“乌萨斯人”。但是记住，皇帝的利刃在盯着你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我们都没有时间了。一旦被伯爵发现你的存在，将会使尚未喘息的乌萨斯再度陷入新的漩涡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使没有人这么想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......别太自以为是，我只是没料到处理一个叛国者，竟会浪费这么长时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你值得我谨慎对待，叛国者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的职责是看守万尼亚大公，而寻找万尼亚大公的“意外”死因，是你唯一的任务。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我令他的死归于平静，如今，我也远离了乌萨斯的国土，我是否真的有......侵犯过乌萨斯的权益？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么是否该为我的生死付出过大的代价，我相信，每个内卫都会做出合理的判断。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——唔唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但眼下，你必须立刻回到乌萨斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伤痛于你而言无足轻重，但被Mon3tr摧毁的管道会使你窒息——溺毙在邪魔的影响中，哪怕那只是尸骸的碎片。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "动作快，那样也许你还能安然回到乌萨斯的国土。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "被目标担心的经验，确实难能可贵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "何况你，一个叛国者，对我的了解甚至远胜于寻常的乌萨斯军人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也从未有与帝国的利刃促膝长谈的经验。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——你活了多久？你又是什么身份？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是大公的私人医生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你本该在我乘车离开的时候刺杀我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也许现在还不迟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "静候佳音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你当为乌萨斯效力，叛国者，你背叛了一个本可让你无限光辉的国家！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听上去，我该十分遗憾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘶......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你热爱那个繁荣昌盛的乌萨斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么，你一定也能看见那些正在烈阳下腐坏的部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尽管新一代的乌萨斯人，正在逐渐遗忘。与日俱下的近况令它们怀念过去，怀念那个宏大幻影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但这真的对乌萨斯百利而无害？当战争带来的红利褪去后，我们真的有解决乌萨斯的千百难题？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "荣誉喂不饱人民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是在给我忠告？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也可以当我在自言自语。我已经不再属于乌萨斯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不再属于乌萨斯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大公死于私人医生的判断，她意图为大公减轻痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但愿你能如愿离开维多利亚的疆土。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......可惜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你若是理解我们所捍卫的，你就能使它更加强盛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "后会有期。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们还会再见的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "............"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......Mon3tr，回来吧，他确实离开了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些痕迹......得处理......唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_169_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凯尔希！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不该出来，海蒂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_169_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你受了伤！好重的伤......我拿来了应急药箱，这个，该怎么用......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我自己来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_169_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凯尔希，到底发生了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "皇帝的利刃，这个名字告诉你的父亲就好，现在你还不必深究。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_169_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好、好的，可是乌萨斯人？乌萨斯人出现在这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们就像乌萨斯的阴影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而这广袤的阴影究竟会洒向何处，只与帝国的太阳有关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "侥幸斥退阴影是没有用的，它仍旧笼罩着我们脚下的道路，建筑也不会因此动摇分毫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这也是乌萨斯，海蒂。这也是乌萨斯的一部分，帝国的冬天，黑色的雪花。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_169_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在此之前，我们得先骗过庄园里的其他人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然避免了最坏的情况，他没有真的将“国度”泼洒在这片土地上......但这样的痕迹，可没办法简单敷衍过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mon3tr。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不太乐意的低鸣）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_169_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呀——！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_169_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这、这是凯尔希的......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "用最快的速度，去杀死两只野兽。然后拖到这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（低鸣）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然后......海蒂，立刻给你的父亲通讯。我需要他们的帮助，来尽可能遮掩真相......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_169_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要、要怎么做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伪证、引导、必要的贿赂。可能没有人比汤姆森更懂得如何对付骑警队了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_169_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的，我知道了——你抓雪做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "降温。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是被卷入了两只野兽的争斗，侥幸逃脱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想必那些让野兽闯进花园的门卫，要受到重罚了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_169_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你，但你伤得这么重，你还要——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们已经避免了最坏的情况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果他执意要以命换命......这里的每一个人，都不可能全身而退。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......然后立刻为我联络一名信使，能够前往萨米的信使。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_169_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萨米？那里太贫瘠了......会花很多时间的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "时间有很多。只要她还活着，我就能收到回信......但愿我还能收到回信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_169_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的伤口......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唔，信件似乎被血打湿了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_manorindoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "外面是不是有什么动静？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欢快的女贵族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪儿的话，伯爵阁下，快别岔开话题，接着讲讲你是怎么胜过那位公爵的猎人的吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，我无意对公爵阁下不敬，但我一时血气方刚，还是没忍住全力比赛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为那位猎人对我说，我不该雇佣萨弗拉人与札拉克人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他还说，公爵赏给他的宅邸里，只有他引以为傲的几位黎博利女佣，和一众孔武有力的丰蹄人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这让我想起了以前为我的花园做工的那位老园丁，从我有记忆起他就在这里工作啦。他就是个札拉克，我可不觉得这有什么不妥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欢快的女贵族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，赞美您的包容。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最后，我射中了那只羽兽，而公爵的猎人却错失机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "附庸风雅的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们的榜样！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我该给公爵留一些面子的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "微醺的商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_176",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "公爵阁下这么赏识您，您就应该尽情表现自己的勇武！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，您说的是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "猎人，弓和羽兽，我很清楚我是谁嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_manorgarden"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（特蕾西娅的字迹......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这么快......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_desert_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奥特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_171_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你会去哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......去乌萨斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去切尔诺伯格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奥特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_171_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......没听过的城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奥特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_171_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去那里做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snow_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_168_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不和我一起去萨米？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我会把柳德米拉带去叙拉古。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然后顺道去维多利亚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这不是你的愿望吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_168_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_168_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_168_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也希望你能活下去，凯尔希。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_manorgarden"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_169_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凯尔希？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的父亲，还有你，海蒂，你们会继承我们在维多利亚的事业。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无论用何种手腕，我们唯一的目的，就是避免这些自诩荣光的城市，沉没在公爵们的内乱之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_169_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......凯尔希阁下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_169_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您......您要走了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "迟早的事情，海蒂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别让伯爵起疑，现在，我们先回宴会吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_manorindoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天呐！发生了什么？您怎么受了这么重的伤！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快让医生过来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_169_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（理查德叔叔......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "附庸风雅的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我看到了什么！两只巨大的野兽！那是什么怪物？您难道被野兽袭击了！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欢快的女贵族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，我早听说前些年的天灾令一些凶恶的野兽遭到了感染......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......没关系，各位先生女士，只是一些皮外伤，海蒂为我处理得很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_169_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（您真的还站得动吗？那可不是普通的......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快别说话了，居然在我的宴会上发生这种事！无能的门卫！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您快过来歇着，来人！去花园里看一看，究竟发生了什么事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "附庸风雅的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，让我去吧，伯爵阁下，我的剑术您当然明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，理查德，你可是我的客人......但是好吧，这正是表现你英雄气概的时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来吧，凯尔希女士，让我的私人医生为您处理一下伤口，他很快就到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_manorindoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，伯爵阁下，打扰了您宴会的雅兴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这是我的失误，女士，竟然让刺客冠冕堂皇地闯入我的庄园！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请您不要深究这件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦......这我当然知道。倒是您丝毫没有动摇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可至少，您能告诉我是什么人吗？他们竟如此胆大妄为......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好吧，能轻易瞒过所有人眼睛的杀手，确实不该是一个碌碌无为的贵族该知道的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凯尔希女士，请答应我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从这些阴谋中保护好汤姆森，我最好的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他不是什么大人物，他保护不了整个国家，但他能保护好我们自己的维多利亚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他能做到我这样的贵族做不到的事，那我能做到的，就是让他放手去做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感谢您并不知道我们具体的计划，却依旧默契地包庇着所有人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈。您说我需要知道吗？我只该扮演好我自己的角色......一只肥美的待宰的羽兽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我倒是知道，从学生时代开始，他就是这样的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......凯尔希女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "向您表示感谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您无需感谢一个处处欺骗了您的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要我的家人和民众还能和平度日一天——就尽管让整片大地来欺骗我嘲笑我吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你我心知肚明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_manorgate"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您就这么急着走？您可还负着伤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是一些皮外伤，已是万幸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伯爵阁下，“那两只野兽”造成的破坏......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白，我明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_169_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凯尔希......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看来，道别就留给年轻人吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看来我得回去了，大家都被野兽吓得不轻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......保重，凯尔希修士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伯爵说得对，年轻人总是会肩负起未来，无论他们是否做好准备。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_169_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叔叔他其实......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使只是维护住维多利亚最偏僻的一角，和平也不会弄虚作假。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "守护家园——是多少世代的维多利亚人所信奉的真理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_169_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的父亲已经尝试在做了，但......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大雪已至。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你准备好了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你会准备好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_169_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_169_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
